thought_1 = "AI should not be seen as a replacement for human intelligence, but rather as a complementary tool that augments our cognitive capabilities and helps us expand our understanding of the world.";
thought_2 = "The relationship between AI and humans is one of symbiosis, where both can learn from each other and work together towards common goals, such as solving complex problems or improving efficiency in various tasks.";
